OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies owning 84 dogs found in
OL,4,A'squalid' home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied being the owner of
OL,7,Fmore than 80 dogs which had been living
OL,8,Fin "squalid conditions" at his home in
OL,9,FDoncaster.
OL,11,FSouth Yorkshire Police and RSPCA
OL,12,Fofficers who rescued the animals from
OL,13,Fthe property at Galley Hill Farm
OL,14,FCottage in Tickhill in April last year
OL,15,Fsaid the conditions in which the dogs
OL,16,Fwere found were the worst they had
OL,17,Fencountered in their careers.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
