OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies owning 84 dogs found in
OL,4,A'squalid' home
OL,5,
OL,6,FDavid Parkes, 61, denied three counts
OL,7,Fof animal welfare offences, arguing at
OL,8,FBarnsley Magistrates' Court on Monday
OL,9,Fthat he did not own or have
OL,10,Fresponsibility for the animals.
OL,12,FHis wife Delphine, 60, and their son
OL,13,FSam, 28, admitted the same offences at
OL,14,Fa hearing earlier this year.
